### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "me@example.com", "password": "SuperSecret123"}

### Login (stores the token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "me@example.com", "password": "SuperSecret123"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Wrong password (expect 401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "me@example.com", "password": "wrong-password"}

### Create a link as me

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"url": "https://spring.io"}

> {% client.global.set("code", response.body.shortCode); %}

### My links
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My links without a token (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls

### Delete my link (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls/{{code}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}